WEBVTT

00:03:58.484 --> 00:04:00.319
as far as our brains are concerned,

00:04:00.361 --> 00:04:05.491
laughing is like exercising, meditating
and having sex at the same time.

00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:06.659
(Laughter)

00:04:06.701 --> 00:04:08.160
But logistically easier.

00:04:08.202 --> 00:04:11.038
JA: Also, efficient.
NB: Yes.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.248
NB: There's a lot to it.

00:04:12.248 --> 00:04:14.333
Alright, so humor works.

00:04:14.917 --> 00:04:17.628
And the really good news
that we want to talk about today

00:04:17.628 --> 00:04:20.464
is that this humor cliff
is actually easy to fix.

00:04:20.506 --> 00:04:22.258
[GLOBAL HUMOR CLIFF]

00:04:22.258 --> 00:04:24.218
(Laughter)

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.596
Isn’t that better?
10 years, but we got there.

00:04:27.596 --> 00:04:28.931
Just a little Sharpie.

00:04:28.973 --> 00:04:33.185
OK, the actual good news
is that our lives are full of humor,